msgid "gdpr_alert_text"
msgstr ""
"We use cookies on this website to enhance your experience of online payments."

msgid "learn_more"
msgstr "Learn more"

msgid "gdpr_modal_text"
msgstr ""
"Our website uses “cookies” and other technologies, which store information "
"on your computer or device, to allow certain data relating to your web "
"browser to be collected. Cookies are widely used on the Internet and allow a "
"website/portal to recognise a user’s device, without uniquely identifying "
"the individual person using the computer. These technologies help to make it "
"easier for you to log on and use the site and provide feedback to us as to "
"which parts of the website you visit, so we can assess the effectiveness of "
"the site and provide a better user experience or serve Flitt adverts to you "
"whilst browsing other sites. For more information, please visit <a "
"href='https://flitt.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Privacy_Policy_flitt.pdf' "
"target='_blank'>https://flitt.com/privacy-policy/</a>"

msgid "remember_card_for_quick_re_payment"
msgstr "Save my card for future payments"

msgid "its_safe"
msgstr "It's safe"

msgid "gdpr_modal_safe_title"
msgstr ""
"Your card details are tokenised, making it safe and convenient for repeat "
"purchases"

msgid "gdpr_modal_safe"
msgstr ""
"<p>We do not record your card details as you enter them. In fact, we "
"instantly encrypt card details and store them in tokenised format. Tokens "
"are random combinations of numbers and characters.<p>Whenever you make "
"another payment, Flitt will use tokens instead of card details so that a "
"potential fraudster won't be able to intercept them. Token data has no value "
"outside of the Flitt payment service."

